{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00476",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 3.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Right, come in and get settled."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.7,
      "end_seconds": 8.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Um, thanks, doctor. It's been a long few days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.02,
      "end_seconds": 13.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Sorry about the wait, we're running a bit behind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.38,
      "end_seconds": 18.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Oh, that's fine. I was just reading something on my phone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.56,
      "end_seconds": 20.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Right, what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.05,
      "end_seconds": 25.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I wanted to get blood in my urine looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.83,
      "end_seconds": 28.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.17,
      "end_seconds": 40.36,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "It's been going on for about three months. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.48,
      "end_seconds": 44.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Have you had it was red twice this week?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.23,
      "end_seconds": 47.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Yes, for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.45,
      "end_seconds": 62.1,
      "duration_seconds": 14.65,
      "text": "Right. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.17,
      "end_seconds": 66.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.3,
      "end_seconds": 72.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pain on passing urine or recent injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.08,
      "end_seconds": 75.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.59,
      "end_seconds": 81.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Alright, is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.51,
      "end_seconds": 93.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.52,
      "end_seconds": 96.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.7,
      "end_seconds": 98.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.44,
      "end_seconds": 102.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.58,
      "end_seconds": 106.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.12,
      "end_seconds": 114.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.37,
      "end_seconds": 117.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Yes, eggs. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.08,
      "end_seconds": 121.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.24,
      "end_seconds": 123.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.27,
      "end_seconds": 140.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.85,
      "end_seconds": 142.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "My grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.24,
      "end_seconds": 145.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.17,
      "end_seconds": 148.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Yeah, of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.2,
      "end_seconds": 159.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.1,
      "end_seconds": 163.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.08,
      "end_seconds": 167.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Okay, do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.19,
      "end_seconds": 179.89,
      "duration_seconds": 11.7,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.36,
      "end_seconds": 183.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.82,
      "end_seconds": 194.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.76,
      "end_seconds": 222.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air, temp 36.9 degrees, heart rate 66. And BP is 115 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.72,
      "end_seconds": 226.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.98,
      "end_seconds": 233.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.08,
      "end_seconds": 238.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.47,
      "end_seconds": 242.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.53,
      "end_seconds": 243.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.2,
      "end_seconds": 272.08,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Putting together what you've described, it fits best with blood in the urine that needs full investigation. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.62,
      "end_seconds": 277.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.81,
      "end_seconds": 298.89,
      "duration_seconds": 20.08,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like blood in the urine that needs full investigation, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blood in your urine for about three months, and no recent injury or pain on passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.82,
      "end_seconds": 302.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.62,
      "end_seconds": 307.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.2,
      "end_seconds": 319.91,
      "duration_seconds": 11.71,
      "text": "Right, yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.07,
      "end_seconds": 330.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "I'm going to order a CT scan of the kidneys and bladder, for haematuria. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.69,
      "end_seconds": 334.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.74,
      "end_seconds": 363.25,
      "duration_seconds": 26.51,
      "text": "Keep drinking plenty of water, and let us know quickly if you pass clots or can't pass urine. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you can't pass urine or pass large clots. I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.71,
      "end_seconds": 367.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.73,
      "end_seconds": 372.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.79,
      "end_seconds": 377.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.51,
      "end_seconds": 383.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. So, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.44,
      "end_seconds": 386.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}